        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "In addition, we have a number of relationships with physicians and other healthcare providers, including management or service contracts.",
        "start_character": 73431,
        "end_character": 73568
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000785161-26-000081",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000785161-26-000081-9d3d2e158b112412",
        "accession_number": "0000785161-26-000081",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "To respond to the strong demand for our services, we continue to develop our current markets through bed additions and construct or acquire hospitals in new markets.",
        "start_character": 16939,
        "end_character": 17104
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000785161-26-000081",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000785161-26-000081-9d3d2e158b112412",
        "accession_number": "0000785161-26-000081",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "service",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "We undertake significant effort and expense to provide the medical, nursing, therapy, and ancillary services required to comply with local, state, and federal regulations as well as applicable accreditation standards, which for most of our hospitals are those of The Joint Commission.",
        "start_character": 59200,
        "end_character": 59484
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000785161-26-000081",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000785161-26-000081-9d3d2e158b112412",
        "accession_number": "0000785161-26-000081",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.96,
        "statement": "territories where we operate, the construction or expansion of facilities, the acquisition of existing facilities, or the introduction of new beds or inpatient services may be subject to review by and prior approval of state regulatory bodies under a “certificate of need,” or “CON,” law.",
