        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "As a healthcare provider, we are subject to periodic audits, examinations and investigations conducted by, or at the direction of, government investigative and oversight agencies.",
        "start_character": 58777,
        "end_character": 58956
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000785161-26-000081",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000785161-26-000081-9d3d2e158b112412",
        "accession_number": "0000785161-26-000081",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Currently, we operate 149 hospitals that hold one or more Joint Commission Disease-Specific Care Certifications, such as stroke rehabilitation, hip fracture rehabilitation, brain injury rehabilitation, amputee rehabilitation, Parkinson’s Disease rehabilitation, and spinal cord injury rehabilitation certification.",
        "start_character": 10617,
        "end_character": 10931
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000785161-26-000081",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000785161-26-000081-9d3d2e158b112412",
        "accession_number": "0000785161-26-000081",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "For example, CMS changed the IRF-PPS, effective October 1, 2019, to replace the FIM™ assessment instrument with new patient assessment measures, which we refer to as “Section GG functional measures” or “Section GG” based on the designation CMS assigned to them.",
        "start_character": 39447,
        "end_character": 39708
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000785161-26-000081",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000785161-26-000081-9d3d2e158b112412",
        "accession_number": "0000785161-26-000081",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "operator_business",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Given the number of locations in which we operate, increasing state and local regulation, which may be more stringent than federal regulation and may even conflict with federal or other state or local regulation, represents a significant burden and risk to us.",
        "start_character": 59931,
        "end_character": 60191
      },
      {
        "business_evidence_id": "business-evidence:SEC-0000785161-26-000081",
        "provenance_id": "provenance:SEC-FILING-0000785161-26-000081-9d3d2e158b112412",
        "accession_number": "0000785161-26-000081",
        "filing_date": "2026-02-26",
        "offering_role": "product",
        "confidence": 0.92,
        "statement": "Historically, we are not aware of any IRFs playing a role in the design given the limited number of IRF Medicaid patients, so we are uncertain what attention state authorities will give to the effects of additional rulemaking on IRFs.",
